Derived and original assets
---------------------------

public/office/atlas.png
    One RGBA image with every tile, prop and character frame of the office, built by
    scripts/build-office-atlas.js (no randomness, a unit test pins the committed file to the
    generator output). Licence: CC0 1.0. It mixes two sources:
    - From the Kenney sheet above (CC0, slices): tile.rug (recoloured from orange to burgundy),
      prop.table.3x2, prop.table.4x2 (the table tiles joined into larger tables),
      prop.counter.11x1 (kitchen units joined into a counter) and prop.frame.1x1.0 to .2
      (framed pictures).
    - Original work (drawn by us in scripts/art/): the floors and walls (tile.wood, tile.carpet,
      tile.kitchen, tile.server, tile.grass, tile.wall-top, tile.wall-face: the Kenney sheet has no
      floor or wall tiles that fit an office, so these are custom), and the props prop.desk (off and
      lit), prop.chair, prop.beanbag, prop.coffee, prop.whiteboard, prop.rack, prop.window,
      prop.plant, prop.table.8x3, prop.shelf, prop.fridge, prop.cooler and prop.bin, all ten chibi
      looks (seven roles plus the fallback; every char.* frame) and their portraits.
public/office/atlas.json
    The frame map of atlas.png, written by the same script. Original data. Licence: CC0 1.0.
public/office/layout.json
    Original data (office floor plan, hand edited). Licence: CC0 1.0.
